ess correctly. Existing applied migration checksums remain unchanged.\n\nThis PR contains only the storage repair on `main@9a99369`. It excludes unrelated changes from the original local working branch. SDAR consumes the exact repair commit `dca0fcdbbe35f94ddaf968b6489decdbf228755a` through its read-only contract boundary.\n\nValidation on the delivery source:\n- `npm run verify`: check, SQL, build and 682 Vitest / 41 STAS tests passed; 33 existing opt-in tests were skipped and are not claimed as acceptance.\n- Six storage unit tests and 43 real PostgreSQL scenarios passed.\n- Populated predecessor upgrade, repeated installation, earlier row/hash preservation, scoped consumer operations and owned-container cleanup passed.\n- Source hashes, raw compressed logs, commands and exit codes: `reports/sdar-storage-closure-20261011/delivery/DELIVERY_VALIDATION.json`.\n\nField operations and deployment: NOT_RUN.\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T15:58:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T15:58:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ffd7932c8bfed2615c8b4730b49637e0f1780c17","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/geospatial-operational-world-model/pulls/23/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/geospatial-operational-world-model/pulls/23/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/geospatial-operational-world-model/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/geospatial-operational-world-model/issues/23/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/geospatial-operational-world-model/statuses/9ba82d59de9e7ecf694c45c457f13887486bbca0","head":{"label":"zhouwen-giser:codex/sdar-storage-delivery","ref":"codex/sdar-storage-delivery","sha":"9ba82d59de9e7ecf694c45c457f13887486bbca0","user":{"login":"zhouwen-giser","id":190796747,"n